# The build context of the docs image (Dockerfile): only what the Hugo site is built from comes in, the site itself
# (docs/site) and the two files it renders from the repository's root (CHANGELOG.md and CONTRIBUTING.md, mounted by
# docs/site/hugo.toml). The application's sources, its build output and its history stay out.
*
!docs/site
!CHANGELOG.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md

# Not part of the site, or rebuilt by the image.
docs/site/node_modules
docs/site/public
docs/site/resources
docs/site/.hugo_build.lock
